msgstr "TUN 未启用：DNS 查询无法到达 mihomo。"

msgid "TUN is off: bound interfaces cannot send DNS to mihomo."
msgstr "TUN 未启用：已绑定接口无法把 DNS 送给 mihomo。"

msgid "TUN mode is enabled (automatic route takeover off)"
msgstr "已启用 TUN 模式（未自动接管路由）"

msgid "TUN mode is off: the bindings below stay inactive until it is on. Enable it in Settings."
msgstr "TUN 模式关着：下面的绑定在它打开之前都不会生效。到「设置」里打开再回来。"

msgid "TUN off"
msgstr "TUN 未启用"

msgid "TUN with automatic route takeover is enabled"
msgstr "已启用 TUN 且自动接管路由"

msgid "Take over the default route. Without working proxy nodes this cuts the network off."
msgstr "接管默认路由；节点不可用时会断网。"

msgid "Test Active Configuration"
msgstr "校验当前配置"

msgid "The DNS module is off: bound interfaces cannot use mihomo DNS."
msgstr "DNS 模块未启用：已绑定接口无法使用 mihomo DNS。"

msgid "The DNS module is off: mihomo cannot answer DNS queries."
msgstr "DNS 模块未启用：mihomo 无法应答 DNS 查询。"

msgid "The DNS upstream block in the configuration file is not closed."
msgstr "配置文件里的 DNS 上游受管区块没有闭合。"

msgid "The TUN device is guaranteed to win over other default routes while the service runs."
msgstr "服务运行时，TUN 设备将优先于其它默认路由。"

msgid "The configuration file has no dns: block."
msgstr "配置文件里没有 dns: 块。"

msgid "The configuration file was not written. mihomo rejected it:%s"
msgstr "配置文件未写入，mihomo 校验未通过：%s"

msgid "The configuration still contains the placeholder server 88.88.88.88 shipped with the plugin. Replace it with a real subscription or real proxy nodes before starting the service."
msgstr "配置里仍是随包分发的占位服务器 88.88.88.88。请在启动服务前换成真实订阅或真实节点。"

msgid "The controller is not reachable. Start the service to see proxy groups."
msgstr "控制器不可达；启动服务后可查看代理分组。"

msgid "The controller is reachable from the network and has no secret, so anyone who can reach it may reconfigure the proxy. Set a secret or bind it to 127.0.0.1."
msgstr "控制器对网络开放且未设密钥，任何能访问它的人都能改代理配置。请设置密钥，或改为只监听 127.0.0.1。"

msgid "The controller listens on 127.0.0.1, so it cannot be reached from the network. A secret is only needed when you bind the controller to a network address."
msgstr "控制器只监听 127.0.0.1，网络侧访问不到；只有把它绑到网络地址时才需要密钥。"

msgid "The firewall rules written by this attempt have been removed, so nothing is bound."
msgstr "本次写入的防火墙规则已撤销，当前没有任何接口被绑定。"

msgid "The key is missing from the file; the core uses its default value."
msgstr "文件里没有这个键，内核使用默认值。"

msgid "The page and the file disagree on %d item(s), but those are still set to \"leave alone\", so the file keeps its own values: %s — clear \"leave alone\" on them to write the page values, or press Import to load the file values into the page."
msgstr "有 %d 项页面和文件对不上，但它们还是「不修改」，所以文件里保持原样：%s —— 想让页面说了算就把它们的勾去掉；想用文件里的值刷新页面就点「从配置导入」。"

msgid "The running service keeps its current in-memory configuration until it is restarted."
msgstr "运行中的服务在重启前仍使用内存中的旧配置。"

msgid "The selected log file will be emptied."
msgstr "选中的日志文件将被清空。"

msgid "The service is not enabled at boot."
msgstr "服务未设置为开机自启。"

msgid "The service is stopped. Use the start button in the page header to bring it up."
msgstr "服务已停止，可用页面右上角的启动按钮将其拉起。"

msgid "The service will be restarted right after the update, which rebuilds the TUN device and its routes. Make sure the new nodes work, otherwise clients behind this firewall may lose connectivity."
msgstr "更新后会立即重启服务，这会重建 TUN 设备及其路由。请确认新节点可用，否则本机后面的客户端可能断网。"

msgid "The subscription script is not installed; subscription updates are unavailable."
msgstr "未安装订阅脚本，无法执行订阅更新。"

msgid "Time"
msgstr "时间"

msgid "Time range"
msgstr "时间范围"

msgid "Total Downloaded / Uploaded"
msgstr "累计下载 / 上传"

msgid "Traffic"
msgstr "流量趋势"

msgid "Traffic exits through this group. Ignored for the direct scope."
msgstr "流量从该代理组出去；范围为「直连」时忽略。"

msgid "Traffic from these interfaces is routed into the mihomo TUN device: %s. While the service is stopped or fails to start, clients on these interfaces lose Internet access."
msgstr "这些接口的流量会被策略路由进 mihomo 的 TUN 设备：%s。在服务停止或启动失败期间，这些接口上的客户端会断网。"

msgid "Traffic only enters the TUN device when firewall or policy routing sends it there."
msgstr "仅当防火墙或策略路由把流量送入 TUN 设备时才会走代理。"

msgid "Type"
msgstr "类型"

msgid "UDP 53 is hijacked; TCP DNS is not covered."
msgstr "只劫持了 UDP 53，TCP DNS 未覆盖。"

msgid "UDP and TCP 53 are hijacked."
msgstr "UDP 与 TCP 53 都已被劫持。"

msgid "Unable to create a staging file in /tmp."
msgstr "无法在 /tmp 创建临时文件。"

msgid "Unable to reach the mihomo external controller."
msgstr "无法连接 mihomo 外部控制器。"

msgid "Unable to write the staging file."
msgstr "无法写入临时文件。"

msgid "Unavailable"
msgstr "暂无数据"

msgid "Unbound is also listening on %s. Keep it off these interfaces, or make sure the TUN policy wins."
msgstr "Unbound 也在这些接口上监听：%s。请让它不要监听这些接口，或确认 TUN 策略优先。"

msgid "Unbound is also listening on this address; the TUN policy normally wins."
msgstr "Unbound 也在这个地址上监听；通常仍是 TUN 策略优先。"

msgid "Undo"
msgstr "撤销"

msgid "Undo network changes"
msgstr "撤销网络配置"

msgid "Unknown log file."
msgstr "未知的日志文件。"

msgid "Unsaved changes"
msgstr "更改尚未保存"

msgid "Up to 128 characters: letters, digits, \".\", \"-\" and \"_\"."
msgstr "最多 128 字符：字母、数字与 . - _。"

msgid "Up to 15 characters: letters, digits, underscore."
msgstr "最多 15 字符：字母、数字、下划线。"

msgid "Update subscription"
msgstr "更新订阅"

msgid "Update the subscription on a schedule."
msgstr "按计划更新订阅。"

msgid "Updating the subscription rebuilds config.yaml from the subscription template, so manual edits are replaced. The current file is backed up as config.yaml.bak.sub_* first."
msgstr "更新订阅会用订阅模板整份重写 config.yaml，手工改过的内容会被替换；更新前会自动备份成 config.yaml.bak.sub_*。"

msgid "Upload"
msgstr "上传"

msgid "Upload rate"
msgstr "上传速率"

msgid "Uploaded"
msgstr "累计上传"

msgid "Upstream policy"
msgstr "上游策略"

msgid "Use %sSettings%s to enable it, then start it from the controls in the page header."
msgstr "请到 %s设置%s 中启用，然后使用页面右上角的控件启动。"

msgid "Validate"
msgstr "校验"

msgid "Validate and save"
msgstr "校验并保存"

msgid "Validated with mihomo -t before it replaces the active file; the previous file is kept as a backup."
msgstr "保存前用 mihomo -t 校验；原文件保留为备份。"

msgid "Validation failed"
msgstr "校验未通过"

msgid "Validation passed"
msgstr "校验通过"

msgid "Waiting for the OPNsense side: apply the routing policy to create the interface, gateway and firewall rule."
msgstr "等待同步 OPNsense 网络侧：应用路由策略以创建接口、网关和防火墙规则。"

msgid "Waiting for the OPNsense side: interface, gateway and policy routing rule."
msgstr "等待同步 OPNsense 网络侧：接口、网关与策略路由规则。"

msgid "Waiting for traffic samples."
msgstr "正在采集流量数据。"

msgid "WebGUI"
msgstr "页面（设置）"

msgid "Writes the mihomo configuration and, where needed, creates the interface, gateway and firewall rule on OPNsense. config.xml is backed up first."
msgstr "写入 mihomo 配置；需要时在 OPNsense 上创建接口、网关和防火墙规则（先备份 config.xml）。"

msgid "Written by the plugin: on Apply the value above is written into the file. Click to leave the file alone instead."
msgstr "由插件写入：点「应用」时按上面的值改配置文件；点一下改为「不修改」。"

msgid "YAML configuration"
msgstr "YAML 配置"

msgid "YAML editor"
msgstr "YAML 编辑器"

msgid "YAML fragment relative to the dns: block: default-nameserver / nameserver / proxy-server-nameserver / direct-nameserver / nameserver-policy / respect-rules. Do not include the dns: line. Empty removes these keys."
msgstr "相对于 dns: 块的 YAML 片段：default-nameserver / nameserver / proxy-server-nameserver / direct-nameserver / nameserver-policy / respect-rules。不要写 dns: 这一行；留空会删除这些键。"

msgid "all interfaces"
msgstr "所有接口"

msgid "apply to take effect"
msgstr "应用后生效"

msgid "bytes"
msgstr "字节"

msgid "checked by the core"
msgstr "内核会校验密钥"

msgid "configured"
msgstr "已配置"

msgid "consistent"
msgstr "一致"

msgid "current"
msgstr "当前"

msgid "different"
msgstr "不一致"

msgid "disabled"
msgstr "已禁用"

msgid "domestic"
msgstr "国内"

msgid "exit IP"
msgstr "出口 IP"

msgid "external-controller is bound to %s. Anyone who can reach that address and knows the secret can reconfigure the proxy. Bind it to 127.0.0.1 — this WebGUI talks to the controller over the loopback interface only."
msgstr "external-controller 绑定在 %s。任何能访问该地址并知道密钥的人都能改代理配置。建议改为 127.0.0.1 —— 本 WebGUI 只通过回环接口与控制器通信。"

msgid "fake-ip returns synthetic addresses, redir-host returns real ones."
msgstr "fake-ip 返回合成地址；redir-host 返回真实地址。"

msgid "in effect"
msgstr "生效中"

msgid "mihomo DNS is only used on interfaces whose traffic is policy-routed into the TUN device. Other interfaces keep using Unbound. Plain DNS on port 53 is hijacked; DoH/DoT and IPv6 DNS are not."
msgstr "只有流量被策略路由进 TUN 的接口才会使用 mihomo DNS；其它接口仍由 Unbound 解析。这里只劫持 53 端口的明文 DNS，DoH/DoT 与 IPv6 DNS 不在其中。"

msgid "mihomo is active and will start again after a reboot."
msgstr "mihomo 正在运行，并会在重启后自动启动。"

msgid "mihomo is not running: DNS on bound interfaces will fail."
msgstr "mihomo 未运行：已绑定接口上的 DNS 会失败。"

msgid "mihomo is not running: DNS on this interface will fail."
msgstr "mihomo 未运行：这个接口上的 DNS 会失败。"

msgid "mihomo rules"
msgstr "mihomo 规则"

msgid "not checked (no secret)"
msgstr "没设密钥，内核不校验"

msgid "not configured"
msgstr "未配置"

msgid "not in file"
msgstr "文件未写"

msgid "not running"
msgstr "未运行"

msgid "nothing bound"
msgstr "未绑定任何接口"

msgid "rule"
msgstr "规则"

msgid "rule: follow the routing rules. global: everything through the selected proxy. direct: no proxy."
msgstr "rule：按规则分流；global：全部走所选节点；direct：全部直连。"

msgid "running"
msgstr "运行中"

msgid "running only"
msgstr "仅运行值"

msgid "stopped"
msgstr "已停止"

msgid "timeout"
msgstr "超时"

msgid "…"
msgstr "未知"

msgid "Could not load the configuration. Try again."
msgstr "配置读取失败，请重试。"

msgid "Start at boot"
msgstr "开机启动"

msgid "Controller secret"
msgstr "控制器密钥"
